## 5. Required attribution

Every deployed graphical user interface must preserve the exact textual notice
"Powered by EmbedLabs" in a persistent, visible, and legible location in the
standard application navigation or footer and on the sign-in interface. The
notice must not be hidden, obscured, replaced, made misleading, or rendered
illegible. It must link to https://embedlabs.net when the interface supports
links.

Modified versions must also provide an accessible Legal or About view that:

1. identifies the Software as originally developed by EmbedLabs;
2. states that the version has been modified and identifies the modifying party;
3. includes this License or a working link to it; and
4. preserves the applicable copyright notices.

This required factual attribution does not grant permission to use EmbedLabs
logos or to present a modified version as an official EmbedLabs release.

